---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { BASE } from '../../site';
---
<Base title="Services" description="Seven practices, one team: web design, managed hosting, cloud and containers, AI, compliance readiness, consultancy, staffing and talent.">
<section><div class="container">
<p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
<h1>Good design is <em>just the beginning.</em></h1>
<p class="lead">Your technology, designed, built and run by one team. Buy one practice, buy all seven — none requires the others.</p>
<p style="max-width:760px"><strong>Ongoing services, one-off projects and staffing are three different things.</strong> Ongoing services are monthly. Projects have a beginning and an end. Staffing is a person, for a fixed period. You can buy any one without the others.</p>

<div class="hub-card hub-web" style="border:1px solid var(--line2);border-top:6px solid var(--hub);border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-top:32px">
<p class="eyebrow">Website Services</p>
<h2>Websites, stores and apps.</h2>
<p>Websites, stores and apps people love to use — and you can edit yourself.</p>
<p><a href={BASE + "/services/web-design"}>Web Design</a> · <a href={BASE + "/services/ux-design"}>UX Design</a> · <a href={BASE + "/services/website-builder"}>Website Builder</a> · <a href={BASE + "/services/no-code-app-builder"}>No-Code App Builder</a> · <a href={BASE + "/services/ecommerce"}>eCommerce Setup</a></p>
<p><a href={BASE + "/services/website-services"}>Explore Website Services →</a></p>
</div>

<div class="hub-card hub-host" style="border:1px solid var(--line2);border-top:6px solid var(--hub);border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-top:20px">
<p class="eyebrow">Managed Hosting</p>
<h2>Hosting that just works.</h2>
<p>Set up, secured, backed up and watched. You never touch a server.</p>
<p><a href={BASE + "/services/managed-wordpress"}>Managed WordPress Hosting</a> · <a href={BASE + "/services/vps-hosting"}>Managed VPS Hosting</a> · <a href={BASE + "/services/dedicated-hosting"}>Dedicated Server Hosting</a></p>
<p><a href={BASE + "/services/managed-hosting"}>Explore Managed Hosting →</a></p>
</div>

<div class="hub-card hub-pro" style="border:1px solid var(--line2);border-top:6px solid var(--hub);border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-top:20px">
<p class="eyebrow">Professional Services</p>
<h2>Cloud, compliance and specialists.</h2>
<p>Cloud, containers, AI, compliance readiness, consultancy and staffing — by specialists.</p>
<p><a href={BASE + "/services/cloud-infrastructure"}>Cloud &amp; Infrastructure</a> · <a href={BASE + "/services/kubernetes"}>Managed Kubernetes</a> · <a href={BASE + "/services/openshift"}>Managed OpenShift</a> · <a href={BASE + "/services/managed-containers"}>Managed Container Hosting</a> · <a href={BASE + "/services/compliance-readiness"}>Compliance Readiness</a> · <a href={BASE + "/services/ai-consulting"}>AI Consulting</a> · <a href={BASE + "/services/consultancy"}>Technology Consultancy</a> · <a href={BASE + "/services/staffing"}>Design &amp; Developer Staffing</a> · <a href={BASE + "/services/talent-marketplace"}>Talent Marketplace</a></p>
<p><a href={BASE + "/services/professional-services"}>Explore Professional Services →</a></p>
</div>

<h2 style="margin-top:40px">All services</h2>
<p style="max-width:760px">Seven practices: Web Design &amp; Experience · Managed Hosting · Cloud &amp; Containers · AI · Compliance Readiness · Consultancy · Staffing &amp; Talent. Every practice has its own page, and every service inside it has its own page.</p>
<div class="note" style="margin-top:28px"><strong>Pricing:</strong> every project is quoted, and we scope before we quote. Tell us your budget. We tell you what fits, before you commit to anything.</div>
<p style="margin-top:32px"><a class="btn" href={BASE + "/contact"}>Contact us →</a></p>
</div></section>
</Base>
